  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">從高山到沙漠！<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1169375/description_7572fd14-c467-47d7-8eb3-957b16ee1f17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"847\" height=\"713\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 擁有探索高山、河流、沙漠與森林的獨特體驗。就像上次一樣，我同樣製作了「作弊版」與「無作弊版」。你將在地圖中心出生，若往西南方走，會發現一條河流與一座巨大的湖泊。繼續前行會看到山脈，山脈的另一側則是一片紅杉林。向東北探索，你會發現帶有山脈與河流的沙漠。還有更多內容等著你！</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">這些專案能順利完成，離不開像您這樣的慷慨捐助。</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>&nbsp;玩得開心，上帝保佑你 :)</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1169375/description_6f35ce5d-1dec-4a42-af48-7e342178a8ab.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"370\" height=\"208\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>試試我的其他地圖！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林與田野</a><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘之島</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七座生存之島</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J</strong></span></p>",
